Ok.  You are in very good shape.  If you are careful now, you should be
able to ascend.

I have ascended in Slashem many times, and I know most of the tricks.

Lets see what I would suggest:

1) Wishing for artifacts - The one Slashem-only artifact that you will
surely want is the Wallet of Perseus, the super BoH that divides weight
by 6 instead of 4.  It is worth wishing for this early to make sure you
get it.  Other artifacts can be obtained through sacrifice.

2) Resistances - As others have mentioned, magic resistance,
reflection, and drain resistance are very important in Slashem.

Personally, I like Polyselfing into a crystal golem to obtain all
important resistances.
Although crystal golems can't wear body armor or chat for protection,
they start with 300 HP, and are: fire,cold,sleep,shock,poison, magic,
and level-drain resistant, as well as intrinsic reflection and magical
breathing.  They also possess a random breath attack ( #monster ), and
have 18/** strength.  You will also lose your barehand sleep attack
while polymorphed, which is a bummer.

Becoming a near-permanent crystal golem requires three items: a source
of polymorph, a source of polymorph control, and an amulet of
unchanging.  Assuming you lack all three of these items, you would need
to use 3 wishes to get them.  Combined with a wish for the Wallet, this
will use 4 of your remaining six wishes.  I would save the remaining
two wishes for emergencies.

I'll give you a few playing hints too.

All the stores in Slashem offer shopkeeper services.  Some offer only
identify, but you should always check to see if the stores offer
uncursing, charging, or enchanting.
Finding a wand store that offers charging, or an armor store that
offers enchanting, can make a huge difference in the game.

There are (wishable) magic candles in slashem, be sure to check the
lighting shops in both the Mall level (which you are on) and in
Minetown to see if they have it first.

Be very cautious of spark or lightning bugs, they can explode all your
wands and kill you with a single hit.



